            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nThis is an intended behavior because [pair can consist only from two characters](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/35422e90b0de232245e2b1d3b3737a7c419d377b/doc/mini-pairs.txt#L123) and customization can be done [only based on two-character cursor neighborhood](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/35422e90b0de232245e2b1d3b3737a7c419d377b/doc/mini-pairs.txt#L9-L10) . See #31 for more details.\r\n\r\nClosing as duplicate.",
